  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed 5.00 metre deep ground floor rear extension, due to its excessive depth, scale and relationship with adjoining neighbouring properties would harm the amenities of the occupiers through a loss of light and outlook, and an increased sense of enclosure. The proposal is therefore contrary to adopted Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), the NPPF and the intent of the Hounslow Character, Sustainability and Design Codes A5 - Residential Extension Guidelines."
